TRANSLATION:
Bugün adada kurduğumuz{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
labirentte yolunu bulacaksın! {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0007:0500}}
dakika{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} içinde içine saklanmış
meyveli hazineleri bul.

EN:
Find {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}5{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
treasures within the time limit to
be rewarded with medals.

DE:
Dieses Mal bringt mir jeder von
euch Sprösslingen jeweils {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}drei
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}Früchte von folgenden Obstsorten:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} und{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}}!

IT:
Questa volta, portami {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tre {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}frutti
per ciascuno dei seguenti tipi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}: ...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}... {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}} {{TAG:000E:0011:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0200}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Portali qui da me entro il tempo
limite e ti ricoprirò di medaglie!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I want {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}5{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
treasures! That's it! Don't bring me
anything else!

DE:
Was soll das Gequassel, Sprössling?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du sollst doch Früchte sammeln!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Na los, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}hopp, hopp!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Estos jóvenes de hoy día os lo 
tomáis todo con mucha calma.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Tráeme esa fruta, granuja!

EN:
Both of you brought me the
fruit treasures I asked for.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
That means you win!

FR:
Chacun d'entre vous m'a ramené les
fruits demandés.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Ce qui signifie{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
que vous avez gagné !

ES:
Ve y échale un cable a tu colega.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Aún no habéis recogido la fruta{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
que os he pedido.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Herkes meyvesini teslim etti;
oyun bitti! Belki{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} de sandığım
kadar sorumsuz değilsiniz, çocuklar!

IT:
E ora vai a dare una mano{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
finché tutta la frutta che ho chiesto
non è stata raccolta!

ES:
Tengo toda la fruta que había
pedido. Ya puedo prepararme
mi macedonia.{{TAG:0007:0009:3C000000}}

EN:
Looks like you ran out of time!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Guess I'll be keeping my medals
for now.

ES:
¡El reloj ha sido más rápido!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Nada, hoy me quedo con mis
medallas.

IT:
Il tempo a disposizione è terminato!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Beh, vorrà dire che per stavolta
le medaglie me le tengo io.

DE:
Die Zeit ist um!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Dann kann ich
meine Medaillen wohl alle behalten,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
he he huff!
